    "sections": {
        "description": "The Cafe Coffee Blocks Theme is a sleek, modern, and feature-rich template designed for cafes, coffee shops, coffee houses, bistros, and specialty coffee businesses that want to create a beautiful and inviting online presence, including concepts like a co-working cafe that blends comfort with productivity. Perfect for showcasing cafe menus, gourmet coffee drinks such as espresso, cappuccino, latte, cold brew, and iced coffee, along with pastries, sandwiches, brunch items, and desserts, this theme offers a visually appealing and creative layout that highlights fresh brews, signature blends, and daily specials. It includes dedicated sections for barista profiles, cafe interiors, seating arrangements, and ambience, making it ideal for modern coffee spaces aiming to attract customers both offline and online. Built with a versatile Gutenberg blocks system, it allows easy customization while supporting features like loyalty programs, online ordering, delivery services, and event promotions. Fully responsive, mobile-friendly, and SEO-optimized, the Cafe Coffee Blocks Theme ensures smooth browsing across all devices, helping cafes establish a strong brand identity and grow as a modern, creative, and customer-friendly destination."
    },
